{
  "name": "Prospeccao Leads - Ad Library",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "pros-0001",
      "name": "Nota Geral Prospeccao",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Prospeccao Leads - Ad Library\nRoda 3x/dia (9h, 13h, 17h). Busca cada nicho ativo no servico de scraping (prospeccao-scraper,\nsem login, sem token do Meta), filtra so anuncios clique-pra-WhatsApp, deduplica por\nad_archive_id, gera mensagem personalizada e deixa pronto pra contato manual no CRM.\n\nREGRA DE GOVERNANCA: este workflow NUNCA envia mensagem pro lead. O primeiro contato e\nsempre manual, feito pela pagina CRM (leads.upviaagentes.com.br), clicando um link wa.me.",
        "width": 900,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-0002",
      "name": "Schedule Prospeccao 3x Dia",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9,13,17 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-0003",
      "name": "Buscar Nichos Ativos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "VxM0N4ryXNa6wkI2",
          "name": "Postgres account 2"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT id AS nicho_id, nome, palavras_chave FROM prospeccao_nichos WHERE ativo = true;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [] }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-0004",
      "name": "Buscar Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "VxM0N4ryXNa6wkI2",
          "name": "Postgres account 2"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT leads_por_rodada FROM prospeccao_config WHERE id = 1;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [] }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-0005",
      "name": "Loop Nichos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-0006",
      "name": "Fim Busca Nichos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-0007",
      "name": "Chamar Servico de Scraping",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        160
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://prospeccao-scraper:3500/buscar",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ termos: $json.palavras_chave, pais: 'BR' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-0008",
      "name": "Extrair Anuncios do Nicho",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const nicho = $('Loop Nichos').first().json;\nconst resposta = $input.first().json;\nconst resultados = (resposta && resposta.resultados) || [];\nconst anuncios = [];\nfor (const r of resultados) {\n  for (const a of (r.anuncios || [])) {\n    anuncios.push({\n      nicho_id: nicho.nicho_id,\n      ad_archive_id: a.ad_archive_id,\n      page_name: a.page_name,\n      ad_creative_body: a.ad_creative_body,\n      ad_snapshot_url: a.ad_snapshot_url,\n      ad_delivery_start_time: a.ad_delivery_start_time\n    });\n  }\n}\nreturn anuncios.map(json => ({ json }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-0009",
      "name": "Tem Anuncios do Nicho?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "pros-000a",
              "leftValue": "={{ $input.all().length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-000b",
      "name": "Fim Iteracao Nicho",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2640,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-000c",
      "name": "Upsert Lead (dedup)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        1540,
        160
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "VxM0N4ryXNa6wkI2",
          "name": "Postgres account 2"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "INSERT INTO prospeccao_leads (nicho_id, ad_archive_id, page_name, ad_creative_body, ad_snapshot_url, ad_delivery_start_time, status)\nVALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5, $6, 'novo')\nON CONFLICT (ad_archive_id) DO NOTHING\nRETURNING id;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.nicho_id, $json.ad_archive_id, $json.page_name, $json.ad_creative_body, $json.ad_snapshot_url, $json.ad_delivery_start_time ] }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-000d",
      "name": "Filtrar Novos Leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// so segue com leads que realmente foram inseridos agora (RETURNING id nao-vazio);\n// duplicados (ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING) voltam sem \"id\" e sao ignorados aqui.\nreturn $input.all().filter(i => i.json && i.json.id);"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-000e",
      "name": "Tem Leads Novos Pra Mensagem?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "pros-000f",
              "leftValue": "={{ $input.all().length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-000g",
      "name": "Loop Leads Novos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        2200,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-000h",
      "name": "Gerar Mensagem Personalizada",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        2420,
        60
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "Voce escreve uma primeira mensagem de prospeccao B2B pelo WhatsApp, em portugues do Brasil,\ntom consultivo e natural (nunca robotico, nunca com cara de copy generico). A mensagem deve\nmencionar especificamente o anuncio que a pessoa esta rodando (sem citar textualmente frases\ninteiras, so referenciar o assunto/oferta dele) e perguntar, de forma leve, se o negocio ja\ntem algum tipo de atendimento/agendamento automatizado no WhatsApp. Maximo 4 frases curtas.\nResponda so com o texto da mensagem, sem aspas, sem explicacao."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Nome do negocio: ' + $('Loop Leads Novos').item.json.page_name + '\\nTexto do anuncio dele: ' + ($('Loop Leads Novos').item.json.ad_creative_body || '').slice(0, 500) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "sjemA3sd4BGEaIHJ",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pros-000i",
      "name": "Salvar Mensagem e Marcar Pronto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        2420,
        260
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "VxM0N4ryXNa6wkI2",
          "name": "Postgres account 2"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "UPDATE prospeccao_leads\nSET mensagem_personalizada = $1, status = 'pronto_para_contato'\nWHERE id = $2;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.message.content, $('Loop Leads Novos').item.json.id ] }}"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
